                                            owl:someValuesFrom :StrategyBehaviourElement
                                          ] ,
                                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                            owl:onProperty :serving ;
                                            owl:someValuesFrom :StrategyBehaviourElement
                                          ] ;
                          rdfs:label "A Strategy Behaviour Element"@en ;
                          <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "represents a unit of strategic activity performed to realize intent"@en .


###  http://www.opengroup.org/ontology/archimate#Structure
:Structure rdf:type owl:Class ;
           rdfs:subClassOf :Concept ;
           rdfs:label "Structure"@en ;
           <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A generic ArchiMate meta-concept that represents the structural organization of the language, grouping elements into layers to reflect their primary role and level of abstraction."@en .


###  http://www.opengroup.org/ontology/archimate#StructureElement
:StructureElement rdf:type owl:Class ;
                  rdfs:subClassOf :Element ;
                  rdfs:label "A structure element"@en ;
                  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "is an element that represents an active or passive structural aspect of an architecture, such as an organizational actor, application component, or device. Structure elements are the basic building blocks of the architecture, and may be assigned behavior elements to model their functionality."@en .


###  http://www.opengroup.org/ontology/archimate#SystemSoftware
:SystemSoftware rdf:type owl:Class ;
                rdfs:subClassOf :Node ,
                                [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                  owl:onProperty :isLayeredIn ;
                                  owl:someValuesFrom :TechnologyLayer
                                ] ;
                rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://bp4mc2.org/def/archimate> ;
                rdfs:label "A System Software"@en ;
                <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "represents software that provides or contributes to an environment for storing, executing, and using software or data deployed within it."@en .


###  http://www.opengroup.org/ontology/archimate#TechnologyCollaboration
:TechnologyCollaboration rdf:type owl:Class ;
                         rdfs:subClassOf :Node ,
                                         [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                           owl:onProperty :isLayeredIn ;
                                           owl:someValuesFrom :TechnologyLayer
                                         ] ;
