                         rdfs:label "A Technology Collaboration"@en ;
                         <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "represents an aggregate of two or more nodes that work together to perform collective technology behavior."@en .


###  http://www.opengroup.org/ontology/archimate#TechnologyEvent
:TechnologyEvent rdf:type owl:Class ;
                 rdfs:subClassOf :Event ,
                                 [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                   owl:onProperty :isLayeredIn ;
                                   owl:someValuesFrom :TechnologyLayer
                                 ] ;
                 rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://bp4mc2.org/def/archimate> ;
                 rdfs:label "A Technology Event"@en ;
                 <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "represents a technology behavior element that denotes a state change."@en .


###  http://www.opengroup.org/ontology/archimate#TechnologyFunction
:TechnologyFunction rdf:type owl:Class ;
                    rdfs:subClassOf :Function ,
                                    :TechnologyInternalBehaviourElement ,
                                    [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                      owl:onProperty :isLayeredIn ;
                                      owl:someValuesFrom :TechnologyLayer
                                    ] ;
