                    rdfs:label "A Technology Function"@en ;
                    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> """represents a collection of technology behavior that can be performed by a 
node."""@en .


###  http://www.opengroup.org/ontology/archimate#TechnologyInteraction
:TechnologyInteraction rdf:type owl:Class ;
                       rdfs:subClassOf :Interaction ,
                                       :TechnologyInternalBehaviourElement ,
                                       [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                         owl:onProperty :isLayeredIn ;
                                         owl:someValuesFrom :TechnologyLayer
                                       ] ;
