                       rdfs:label "A Technology Interaction"@en ;
                       <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "represents a unit of collective technology behavior performed by (a collaboration of) two or more nodes."@en .


###  http://www.opengroup.org/ontology/archimate#TechnologyInterface
:TechnologyInterface rdf:type owl:Class ;
                     rdfs:subClassOf :Interface ,
                                     [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                       owl:onProperty :isLayeredIn ;
                                       owl:someValuesFrom :TechnologyLayer
                                     ] ;
                     rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://bp4mc2.org/def/archimate> ;
                     rdfs:label "A Technology Interface"@en ;
                     <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "represents a point of access where technology services offered by a node can be accessed."@en .


###  http://www.opengroup.org/ontology/archimate#TechnologyInternalActiveStructureElement
:TechnologyInternalActiveStructureElement rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                          rdfs:subClassOf :InternalActiveStructureElement ;
                                          rdfs:label "A Technology Internal Active Structure Element"@en ;
                                          <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "element is an element that performs technology behavior and is assigned to one or more technology behavior elements. The three types of technology internal active structure elements are node, device, and system software."@en .


###  http://www.opengroup.org/ontology/archimate#TechnologyInternalBehaviourElement
:TechnologyInternalBehaviourElement rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                    rdfs:subClassOf :InternalBehaviourElement ;
                                    rdfs:label "A Technology Internal Behaviour Element"@en ;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "describes the internal behavior performed by a node or communication path that is required to realize a technology service."@en .


###  http://www.opengroup.org/ontology/archimate#TechnologyLayer
:TechnologyLayer rdf:type owl:Class ;
