###  http://www.opengroup.org/ontology/archimate#TechnologyObject
:TechnologyObject rdf:type owl:Class ;
                  rdfs:subClassOf :TechnologyPassiveStructureElement ,
                                  [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                    owl:onProperty :isLayeredIn ;
                                    owl:someValuesFrom :TechnologyLayer
                                  ] ;
                  rdfs:label "A technology Object"@en ;
                  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "represents a passive element that is used or produced by technology behavior."@en .


###  http://www.opengroup.org/ontology/archimate#TechnologyPassiveStructureElement
:TechnologyPassiveStructureElement rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                   rdfs:subClassOf :PassiveStructureElement ;
                                   rdfs:label "A Technology Passive Structure Element"@en ;
                                   <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "is an element that models an object on which behavior is performed within the technology layer. The only defined technology passive structure element is the artifact."@en .


###  http://www.opengroup.org/ontology/archimate#TechnologyProcess
:TechnologyProcess rdf:type owl:Class ;
                   rdfs:subClassOf :Process ,
